# this file was written. If the hook starts flagging these again after an unrelated edit,
# the finding did not reappear — the line moved. Re-derive with:
#     gitleaks detect --source . --no-git --report-format json --report-path /tmp/fp.json
# and copy the new Fingerprint values here. Do NOT silence them by deleting the keys: they
# are load-bearing test fixtures.

